8}]}, {"n": 16, "text": "अब Szechuan के तीखे खाने में आपको क्या खास बात दिखती है?", "start": 94.651, "end": 98.79, "words": [{"w": "अब", "start": 94.651, "end": 95.271}, {"w": "Szechuan", "start": 95.271, "end": 95.811}, {"w": "के", "start": 95.811, "end": 96.071}, {"w": "तीखे", "start": 96.071, "end": 96.351}, {"w": "खाने", "start": 96.351, "end": 96.791}, {"w": "में", "start": 96.791, "end": 97.211}, {"w": "आपको", "start": 97.211, "end": 97.631}, {"w": "क्या", "start": 97.631, "end": 97.911}, {"w": "खास", "start": 97.911, "end": 98.151}, {"w": "बात", "start": 98.151, "end": 98.331}, {"w": "दिखती", "start": 98.331, "end": 98.591}, {"w": "है", "start": 98.591, "end": 98.751}]}, {"n": 17, "text": "उसमें बाहर से आई चीजों का हाथ है।", "start": 99.09, "end": 101.484, "words": [{"w": "उसमें", "start": 99.09, "end": 99.89}, {"w": "बाहर", "start": 99.89, "end": 100.09}, {"w": "से", "start": 100.09, "end": 100.27}, {"w": "आई", "start": 100.27, "end": 100.49}, {"w": "चीजों", "start": 100.49, "end": 100.91}, {"w": "का", "start": 100.91, "end": 100.95}, {"w": "हाथ", "start": 100.95, "end": 101.49}, {"w": "है।", "start": 101.49, "end": 101.49}]}, {"n": 18, "text": "पुराने समय में Buddhist monks silk route से मसाले लाए, और किताब के विवरण के मुताबिक पंद्रहवीं सदी में Portuguese traders मिर्च लाए; इनसे Szechuan का बेहद तीखा cuisine बना।", "start": 101.784, "end": 113.121, "words": [{"w": "पुराने", "start": 101.784, "end": 102.284}, {"w": "समय", "start": 102.284, "end": 102.584}, {"w": "में", "start": 102.584, "end": 102.844}, {"w": "Buddhist", "start": 102.844, "end": 103.344}, {"w": "monks", "start": 103.344, "end": 103.884}, {"w": "silk", "start": 103.884, "end": 104.184}, {"w": "route", "start": 104.184, "end": 104.444}, {"w": "से", "start": 104.444, "end": 104.604}, {"w": "मसाले", "start": 104.604, "end": 105.184}, {"w": "लाए", "start": 105.184, "end": 105.424}, {"w": "और", "start": 105.544, "end": 105.844}, {"w": "किताब", "start": 105.844, "end": 106.304}, {"w": "के", "start"